  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICT Networking and Entrepreneurship Development</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Redes TIC y desarrollo empresarial</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Bajo esta alianza p&#xFA;blico-privada, World Learning y CISCO establecen cursos extracurriculares y de verano sobre tecnolog&#xED;a de la informaci&#xF3;n y emprendimiento en cuatro comunidades (una en Monterrey, otra en Tijuana y dos en Ciudad Ju&#xE1;rez). Se espera que 1.200 j&#xF3;venes y sus familias se beneficien de capacitaci&#xF3;n empresarial a trav&#xE9;s de Institutos de Emprendimiento, y 660 j&#xF3;venes se beneficiar&#xE1;n de cursos de tecnolog&#xED;a de la informaci&#xF3;n ofrecidos a trav&#xE9;s de Academias de Redes. Esta actividad se est&#xE1; implementando a trav&#xE9;s de una alianza p&#xFA;blico-privada con CISCO, administrada por World Learning.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under this public-private alliance, World Learning and CISCO establish after-school and summer information technology and entrepreneurship courses in four communities (one each in Monterrey and Tijuana and two in Ciudad Juarez). 1,200 youth and their families are expected to benefit from entrepreneurship training through Entrepreneurship Institutes, and 660 youth will benefit from information technology courses offered through Networking Academies. This activity is being implemented through a public-private alliance with CISCO, managed by World Learning.</narrative>
  </description>
